para('The figure shows each pair\'s maximum eligible absolute DSI interaction over the two speeds and eight subtypes for each model/strength. It is a finite-set descriptive maximum, not a multiplicity-adjusted discovery claim. The reporting supplement excludes 124 undefined pair DSI contrasts;900 remain eligible. Archival arithmetic arrays are retained, alongside validity masks, raw readouts and normalized contrasts. The normalized denominator floor is0.10 for DSI and0.01 in each raw readout\'s units.',True)
para('The largest raw interaction comes from model004, full Mi4/Mi9 attenuation at native speed9.5. Joint voltage reaches about13,897 model units within the scored window and77.3 million later in the saved trial. Finite arithmetic does not certify stability or physiological plausibility. This severe amplification is a model limitation, not evidence of biological synergy.',True)
para(f'The declared model000 ON60 diagnostic found up to {", ".join(str(v) for v in relu["max_differing_nodes"])} changed ReLU activity signs for Mi1, Tm3 and their pair, among45,669 nodes. This does not uniquely explain the interactions; recurrent operator changes can interact even without a gate crossing.',True)
