h('Eligibility and outcome')
para('<b>Not tested under matched conditions.</b> Matching speed does not match the full Ammer2015 assay: it recorded HS/VS voltage and behaviour under Kir2.1 silencing, whereas this study measures model T4/T5 voltage after acute outgoing-current attenuation. Geometry, adaptation and perturbation mechanism also differ. Model speed dependence is reported descriptively, without a biological correctness score or a claim of replication.')
para('The Tm1/Tm2/Tm4/Tm9 pair results likewise do not reproduce the Serbe2016 one-copy shibire/calcium assay. Its weaker paired blocks must be compared with corresponding one-copy singles, and the paper does not support complete redundancy. These biological rows remain unmatched, rather than counted as model disagreement.')
para('Sources: '+link('Ammer et al. 2015','https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cub.2015.07.014')+'; '+link('Serbe et al. 2016','https://doi.org/10.1016/j.neuron.2016.01.006')+'. The preserved biology-key.csv provides assay details, source locators and evidential status. This study adds model experiments, not new biological measurements.',True)
page()

