para('The final worker was interrupted on2 October and resumed on3 October from checksum-verified condition files. The compute ledger combines completed development/resume wall times, preserved original final-panel times and recorded partial-panel work. Untimed initialization, an incomplete batch and interruption overhead make the total a lower bound; overnight downtime is excluded.',True)
para('Stage2 gradient/runtime behavior has not been directly measured. Its allowance is twice the cell-gradient cost plus25% and15minutes, so additional models, stimuli or connection-method changes require a fresh cost gate. Local GPU rental cost is not applicable. No hardware energy or depreciation estimate is claimed.')
para(f"Using completed Stage1 throughput instead of the pilot gives an updated Stage2 projection of {actual['stage2_extrapolation']['additional_connection_exact_hours']:.2f} GPU hours for additional exact connection runs, or {actual['stage2_extrapolation']['with_allowances_hours']:.2f} hours with allowances. Actual Stage1 peak worker RSS was {actual['peak_rss_mib']/1024:.2f} GiB and peak CUDA reserved memory {actual['peak_cuda_reserved_mib']/1024:.2f} GiB.")
h('Limits on interpretation')
para('Baseline DSI ranges across the sixteen subtype/speed units per model: '+ '; '.join(f"{r['model']} {r['baseline_dsi_range'][0]:.3f}-{r['baseline_dsi_range'][1]:.3f}" for r in summary if r['strength']==.5)+'. The diagnostics file identifies individual units below0.10; their effects stay descriptive and do not support loss-of-selectivity claims.',True)
para('Four models, only two held out, support finite-set descriptions rather than stable population intervals or universal method rankings. Synthetic moving edges and central T4/T5 outputs do not establish generality to natural scenes, behaviour, all spatial positions or other readouts. Development and final sets differ in both models and speeds; their score differences cannot isolate either source of generalization. Directions are reused across splits. Direct-input baselines may miss indirect pathways. The learned models and anatomical reference are not independent biological evidence.')
para('The literature decision remains NARROW: FlyVis silencing and biological benchmarking already exist. No first-use, complete causal-map or unique-mechanism claim is made. Activation interchange, mean/resample ablation, edge-circuit discovery, Sintel/decoder experiments and the research paper remain separate work.',True)
